  "description": "MigraDoc is a .NET library that allows developers to create documents such as PDF and RTF using a high-level object model. It provides an intuitive API that simplifies the creation of documents, including text formatting, tables, images, and more. MigraDoc is widely used for generating reports, invoices, and other types of documents in various applications.\nThis package relies on Windows Presentation Foundation (WPF) and can be used under Windows only.\nSee https://docs.pdfsharp.net for details.",
